# The extracts are 3.5 GB by default and 30 GB for Europe, and are only ever
# read by the Go build, which runs on the host. Never ship them into a context.
data/
build/records.ndjson.gz

.git/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
# A build-info file without its outputs makes tsc skip emitting entirely: it
# believes the build is current, and dist/ is excluded above.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
*.md
!README.md

# build/index/ is deliberately NOT excluded: the `bundled` target copies it.
